WEBVTT

NOTE Unofficial English translation of the Thai narration. If it differs from the Thai original documents, the Thai original prevails.

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:06.575
The Senate Committee on Agriculture
and Cooperatives has scheduled

00:00:06.575 --> 00:00:10.639
Meeting No. 40/2569 for
Monday, 23 November 2026.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:17.780
At 2 p.m., in committee room CA
331, 3rd floor, Parliament House.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:21.500
The committee chair is
Mr. Sountorn Chaokijka.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.140
The agenda has six items.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:30.776
Announcements from the chair, adoption
of the minutes, matters arising,

00:00:30.776 --> 00:00:36.332
matters for information, matters for
consideration, and other business.

00:00:36.413 --> 00:00:41.135
Under matters for consideration,
the meeting will consider the draft

00:00:41.135 --> 00:00:45.302
study report on managing integrated
agricultural networks to

00:00:45.302 --> 00:00:49.677
international standards for the
environment and sustainability.

00:00:50.679 --> 00:00:57.094
At Meeting No. 38 on 9 November, the
chair of the Integrated Agricultural

00:00:57.094 --> 00:01:02.718
Networks subcommittee reported
progress on drafting this report.

00:01:02.799 --> 00:01:07.981
The study aims to develop integrated
area-based management along

00:01:07.981 --> 00:01:12.678
the whole value chain: upstream,
midstream and downstream.

00:01:12.759 --> 00:01:16.602
And it recommends setting up
an "integrated value-added

00:01:16.602 --> 00:01:20.724
agro-industrial zone" as a
central area linking production,

00:01:20.724 --> 00:01:23.938
research, processing,
logistics and marketing.

00:01:24.939 --> 00:01:29.219
The committee's three current
subcommittees are chaired as follows.

00:01:29.299 --> 00:01:32.879
Livestock and Fisheries:
Mr. Ruchu Kaewlai.

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:39.219
Water Management in Farm Areas Outside
Irrigation Zones: Miss Amorn Sribunnak.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:43.639
And Integrated Agricultural
Networks: Mr. Choocheep Auekarn.

00:01:44.639 --> 00:01:47.558
This meeting was
scheduled by a resolution

00:01:47.558 --> 00:01:50.199
of the meeting on Monday, 16 November.

00:01:50.279 --> 00:01:52.778
Under other business,
the meeting will set

00:01:52.778 --> 00:01:55.039
the date and time of its next meeting.

00:01:56.039 --> 00:01:59.419
This preview is based on the
committee's meeting notice.

00:01:59.499 --> 00:02:02.499
Meeting results are available
through the channels

00:02:02.499 --> 00:02:04.479
of the Secretariat of the Senate.

